# Copy this file to apps/travel/.env.local. Next reads .env.local from the app
# directory, not from the repository root, which is the trap worth naming: a key
# placed at the root is silently ignored and live mode stays disabled with no
# explanation.
#
# Replay and chaos modes need none of this. They are deterministic, make no
# network calls, and are the two modes the eval numbers come from. Live mode is
# the only one that spends anything.

# Enables live mode. Without it the live button is disabled and says why.
# Get one from https://console.anthropic.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to claude-opus-5.
# GENUI_GUARD_MODEL=claude-opus-5
